  "notes": "Cash basis city. Governmental from the Total column of the cash-basis governmental funds statement (p4: General + Bond). 'Intergovernmental - state' 298,714 split with the p8 General Fund Intergovernmental breakdown (motor vehicle fee and tax, homestead, pro rate, highway allocation); remainder 10,175 is Library state aid 1,008 (p11 combining) + Bond Fund 9,167 (p4), kept with the parent label. Grants and donations 27,606 printed under Other Financing Sources on p4 -> other_financing (and detail other financing). Fund balances (p4) recorded as fund balance; ending_cash = Statement of Net Position governmental 'Cash' 13,158,812 (p1 = cash in bank 13,150,092 + county treasurer 8,720, p3); beginning cash not printed. Business-type (Water, Sewer) from the accrual proprietary statement p6 Total column (same figures as the Statement of Activities p2); no single printed total, so operating + nonoperating computed. Proprietary cash flows (p7) recorded; its capital financing total is misprinted (report_discrepancies); its ending cash 5,729,724 vs p1/p5 cash 5,729,722. Balance sheet: governmental lines from p3 (Total column; totals equal the government-wide governmental column), business-type lines from p1 Business-type column; p5 proprietary net position (Water/Sewer columns: cash 3,785,265 + cash-restricted 1,944,457, land 295,938, system 8,091,096, less depreciation 4,988,968) is the fund-level breakdown of the same figures and is not added again. Detail: General Fund budget schedule (p8), Bond Fund (p9), proprietary budgetary schedule (p10), as in FY2024; the p11 combining schedule of General sub-funds (General, Sales Tax, Library, Auditorium, Park, Streets, Keno Community Betterment) covers the same General Fund money and is not entered to avoid double counting. Note p11 itself: its column totals of disbursements add to 1,945,649/1,945,648 and its column net changes add to 2,887,111, but it prints a total net change of 2,895,214 (= p4), a gap of 8,103 against the p4 General disbursements 1,937,545. Water budget-basis Bond proceeds line has no actual (budget 2,661,000), not recorded. Water notes payable 2,240,407 issued during the year with no proceeds line (decision_needed). Several printed totals off by 1 (rounding, report_discrepancies). No transfers printed. Read pages 1-12 of 12."
